        <Tag>TXT_KEY_PROJECT_FAIRY_INVITE_HOUSE_FANE_STRATEGY</Tag>
        <English>Grants access to the [LINK=TRAIT_HOUSE_FANE]House Fane[\LINK] trait. Recommend for playstyles that uses Arcane Units much, as the unique building makes them level up faster.</English>
    </TEXT>
