        <Tag>TXT_KEY_PROJECT_FAIRY_INVITE_HOUSE_DAWAR_STRATEGY</Tag>
        <English>Grants access to the [LINK=TRAIT_HOUSE_DAWAR]House Dawar[\LINK] trait. Recommend for playstyles that uses many Mines. If you uses Kilmorph as Religion, it is highly recommend to pick this trait.</English>
    </TEXT>
